flowchart TD
  CI[CI Runner / Local PC] --> Scenario[roomci Scenario Runner]
  Scenario --> Reports[Markdown / JSON / JUnit Reports]
  Scenario --> LocalBroker[Local MQTT Broker]
  Scenario --> CloudBroker[Cloud MQTT Broker Mock]
  IPad[iPad Controller Simulator] <--> LocalBroker
  LocalBroker <--> Edge[Edge Server Emulator]
  Edge --> DALI[DALI-like Lighting]
  Edge --> Modbus[Modbus Device Mock]
  Edge --> Contact[Contact I/O]
  Edge --> HVAC[HVAC / Comfort Model]
  Edge --> BMS[BMS / Ops Alerts]
  BMS --> Slack[Slack Mock]
  BMS --> Phone[Phone Escalation Mock]
  BMS --> Ticket[Ticket State]
  LocalBroker <--> Bridge[Cloud Bridge]
  Bridge <--> CloudBroker
  Scenario --> Network[Network Fault Injection]
  Network --> WAN[WAN / Backup Link Failover]
  Network --> VLAN[VLAN Isolation]
